10→ *   bun run release:patch              # Interactive release
11→ *   bun run release:minor              # Minor version bump
12→ *   bun run release:major              # Major version bump
13→ *   bun scripts/release.ts patch --yes # Headless (no prompts)
14→ *   bun scripts/release.ts minor --dry-run  # Validate only
15→ *
16→ * Flags:
17→ *   --yes, -y       Skip all interactive prompts (for agents/CI)
18→ *   --dry-run       Validate everything but don't make changes
19→ *   --skip-checks   Skip typecheck and lint during validation
20→ */
